# Manufacturer operator manuals. Device cards are the owner's AUTHORED SUMMARY
# referencing these; the manuals themselves are third-party copyrighted works
# and must never be committed. Defensive: vent_module.lint_device_cards()
# checks card text against manual text when it is present locally, and this
# keeps "present locally" from becoming "present in the repo".
*.manual.*
.manual.
manuals/
# Local working files (review docs, drafts, old versions)
EdgeCDSS_openai_*
*.docx
tests/

# Runtime logs
logs/
*.jsonl

# Change logs — an audit trail of a deployment, not source.
server/drug_concentrations.log.jsonl
server/drug_contracts.log.jsonl
